error[E4017]: cannot use '+=' on the value of the state 's': its type 'String' is not 'Copy', so it cannot be read out of the state
  --> main.prism:7:5
    7 |     s.value += "x"
      |     ^
   = help: assign the result, which reads the value in place: 's.value = s.value + "x"'
   = help: or transform the value: 's.update { it + "x" }'
